  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">歡迎來到 Belgie 的更多村民 Forge 版</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">這是一款適用於 Forge 的模組，它在不新增任何新方塊/物品的情況下，為遊戲加入了更多村民職業。所有村民職業及其交易內容和工作站均列於下方</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">Fabric 版本請至此處查看：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#000\"><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/belgies-mo-villagers-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">點我前往 Forge 版本</a></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">若您發現任何錯誤或是有建議，請在此處或 Discord 上告知我</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#800080\">我的 Discord 連結：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#000\"><a style=\"color:#000\" href=\"https://discord.gg/C9jkQda\" rel=\"nofollow\">點我前往 Discord</a></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ACwj7RS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"1599\"><br><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:36px;background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwinternode.com%252fgames%252fminecraft%252f%253fgclid%253dCjwKCAiAheacBhB8EiwAItV